# Jenkins reuses the same workspace across builds and the "Download Helm
# Charts" stage runs after this Docker build stage, so charts downloaded/
# extracted by the *previous* build (including the large kube-prometheus-stack
# chart) sit here and get sent to the Docker daemon as build context every
# time - this alone was ~900MB of unnecessary context per build.
terraform
